title: The Proletarian Hundreds
subtitle: Workers' squads and price committees spread across Germany.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1923 and month = 2
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.news('Proletarian hundreds drill in Saxony and Thuringia', 2);
!}

= The Proletarian Hundreds

Coal is rationed and the mark falls by the day. In the markets control committees look for hoarded butter and potatoes, and in Saxony, Thuringia and Berlin young workers form **proletarian hundreds**, drilling in the evenings with sticks and, here and there, with rifles from 1920. Social Democrats join them as often as communists.

The Zentrale must decide what to make of them.

- @open: Build the hundreds openly, with the SPD workers.
- @committees: Put the effort into the control committees.
- @apparatus: Build a secret military apparatus, with Moscow's help.

@open
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Hundreds in three hundred towns. Prussia will not stand for it long.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed formations.
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.against('uprising');
RG.district('saxony', {guards: 3});
RG.district('thuringia', {guards: 2});
RG.district('berlin', {guards: 1.5, repression: 4});
Q.e23_hundreds = 1;
Q.spd_relation += 2;
!}

By March there are hundreds in three hundred towns. In Saxony they march past the Landtag in grey windcheaters, and the SPD ministers wave from the windows.

@committees
subtitle: [? if lock_councils = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Unarmed and popular. Social Democratic workers come to our meetings.
choose-if: lock_councils < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids it.
