if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.against('councils');
Q.e23_hundreds = 2;
Q.worker_support += 5;
Q.spd_relation += 4;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

Housewives who have never been to a meeting come to ours to report a grocer.

@apparatus
subtitle: Russian officers, money and hidden rifles. Few in the Zentrale will know how it works.
on-arrival: {!
RG.ecci('trotsky', 6);
Q.e23_hundreds = 3;
Q.red_guards_arms += 8;
Q.resources += 1;
Q.independence -= 6;
!}

Russian officers arrive with false passports. A military apparatus is built in secret, with its own couriers, its own stores and its own lists.
